{card:Awakening}
image:"%%"
{widgets}
prompt:{"type":"field","size":[380,70],"pos":[7,26],"locked":1,"align":"center","value":"\nThe memories crash over you like waves.\nYou see it all. Your life, your death, your endless wandering.\nThe truth burns bright and terrible.\nYou are already gone. You have always been gone."}
