{card:WhiteRoomLoopEnd}
{widgets}
prompt:{"type":"field","size":[380,80],"pos":[10,20],"locked":1,"align":"center","value":"\nThe cycle completes.\nMemory fades. Self dissolves. The burden lifts.\nIn the white room, there is no past, no pain, no you.\nPerhaps this is the only true freedom:\nTo be nothing at all."}
